        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 334-RDT, Round Pocket Door Passage Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Round Pocket Door Passage Set has a clean look and easy installation, and is made to fit standard pre-drilled doors (2-1/8\" diameter bore hole). Normally used when a pre-drilled door is installed as a sliding pocket door, and the door does not need to latch or lock. Express who you with one of the  available finishes that complements your home. Good for doors with 2-3/8\" backsets. Adjustable for door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Passage Function (hall or closet):</b> can be used on any single pocket door that does not need to lock such as on a closet door or in a hallway. It latches but does not lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available locking privacy function. <a href=\"/products/round-pocket-door-lock-privacy-kwikset-335\"><b>Kwikset Round Privacy Pocket Lock</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Kwikset 334 Round Pocket Door Passage Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Prep: 2-1/8\" Face Bore, 1\" Edge Bore.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-3/4\" round corner, steel. Accommodates flat and beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: standard flat or phillips screws.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged complete with all installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
